# React CV Patterns

- Keep `profile` in `src/App.jsx` as the single source of truth for CV data.
- If CV content changes, ensure the website, PDF export, and Word export still use the same `profile` data.
- Use functional React components and simple helper functions.
- Avoid adding routing, state libraries, or backend code unless the user asks for a larger app.
- Keep styling in `src/styles.css` and preserve responsive behavior for mobile screens.
- Use accessible HTML: real buttons for actions, useful link text, and semantic sections/articles.
- Keep export buttons working after edits: PDF should download `.pdf`, Word should download `.docx`.
- After editing React or CSS, run `npm.cmd run build` and check lints for changed files.
